               <title>Package/Label Principal Display Panel </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>COMPARE TO the active ingredient of CHILDREN’S CLARITIN<sup>®</sup> See side panel</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>OUR PHARMACIST RECOMMENDED</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Ages 2 Years &amp; Older</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Non-Drowsy*</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>children’s Allergy Relief</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Loratadine Oral Solution, 5 mg/5 mL</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Antihistamine</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>INDOORS &amp; OUTDOOR ALLERGIES</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>24 HOUR</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>24 HOUR RELIEF OF:</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Sneezing; Runny Nose; Itchy, Watery Eyes &amp; Itchy Throat or Nose</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>DYE-FREE</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Grape Flavor</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>4 FL OZ (118 mL)</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>*When taken as directed.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>See Drug Facts Panel.</paragraph>
